    "sub_ename": "MARKETING STRATEGY OF FINANCIAL COMMODITIES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目的除了提供同學對於金融商品行銷策略的基本認知外，並經由邀請實務界專家演說及企業參訪使同學對金融商品行銷策略有通盤的瞭解。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to offer students a basic concept of financial marketing strategy. Through the lectures of invited experts in this practical filed and business visiting, we hope that students can have a comprehensive understanding of financial marketing strategy",
